          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chu anyun ko ki laitorinik che kilaitoran eng’ emetab Edom, kotomo kolaitoran laitorianda eng’ lagokab Israel: Bela weritab Beor; ak kainetab nganasennyi ko ki Dinaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Bela, ak kilaitoran Jobab weritab Sera ne bo Bosra kogeer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Jobab, ak kilaitoran Husam ne bo emetab Temanik kogeer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Hadad, ak kilaitoran Hadad weritab Bedad kogeer inendet, ne kiga bar Midian eng’ warengetab Moab: ak kainetab nganasennyi ko ki Abit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Hadad, ak kilaitoran Samla ne bo Masreka kogeer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Samla, ak kilaitoran kogeer inendet, Shaul ne bo Rehobot ne kimi ole negite Ainet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Shaul, ak kilaitoran Baal-hanan weritab Akbor kogeer inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Baal-hanan ak kilaitoran Hadad kogeer inendet; ak kainetab nganasennyi ko ki Pai: ak kainetab osotiondennyi ko ki Meetabel cheptab Matred, cheptab Me-sahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kime Hadad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
